Parallel Life Kit

This small, separately implemented project takes design inspiration from
JoyAI Full Duplex, maintained by XGEN-Labs and its contributors.

Upstream repository: https://github.com/XGEN-Labs/joyai_full_duplex
Reviewed upstream revision: b3482509a741da82bb9cfcde75d500a415c58833
Relevant upstream directory: services/webinfer/agent_memory/
Relevant designs: evidence-linked memory derivation, separate persistent and
working context, bounded context compilation, and retrieval before generation.

The upstream repository distributes its code under the Apache License 2.0.
A copy of that license is included in LICENSE. No upstream NOTICE file was
present at the reviewed repository root.

Changes in this project: a new compact Python/SQLite implementation focused on
confirmed autobiographical snapshots, counterfactual branches, deterministic
world settlement, character-specific context, and real-provider text/images.
The upstream audio/video services, large agent runtime, and model weights are
not included. This project does not claim upstream endorsement or equivalence.

Provider services, models, and generated outputs remain subject to their own
service terms. No API credentials are included in the distributed repository.

Dialogue architecture references (2026-09-22): SillyTavern
06bde939fb1e9c4c8d8641d810f0a916b5bce127 (AGPL-3.0) and RisuAI
669b12ceabe1c5066d3dadbe0973f2188d10cc97 (GPL-3.0).
Only public architectural mechanisms were studied; no upstream source,
character cards, preset prompts or dialogue examples were incorporated.
See docs/DIALOGUE_DESIGN.md for exact sources and independently written changes.
